{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>譚詠麟（校長）一連五場的《譚詠麟與您「刻骨銘心」世界巡迴演唱會—終極篇》今晚（11日）在紅館正式開鑼，首場演出獲不少好友捧場，包括曾志偉、李克勤、盧淑怡、任達華、琦琦、鄺美雲、馬海倫等。當中最搶鏡的一定是城中富豪劉鑾雄，他雖然戴着口罩坐在第一行，但依然被粉絲認出，有兩位粉絲更上前邀請大劉合照，大劉亦十分友善除下口罩與粉絲合照，而劉太甘比之後亦有帶同細女入場睇騷。</p><figure><img alt=\"大劉劉鑾雄。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183807352147968809134.jpeg/-ZUQU_Ata3RBA4yC0gGeQVASHDhUoP39biSdp1sknac\"/><figcaption>大劉劉鑾雄。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"除下口罩與粉絲合照。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183805179367424834716.jpeg/qbGMdQDjqgaU0w-n7R0PMaWfIJoDLjo8uJfx-I2X8fg\"/><figcaption>除下口罩與粉絲合照。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"除下口罩與粉絲合照。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183816751845376792503.jpeg/WhfeAWvwZHk4LJrpmEtPU04xsw5kaWbrU9NmaGbTZmg\"/><figcaption>除下口罩與粉絲合照。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"甘比之後亦有帶同細女入場睇騷。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183803061112832640397.jpeg/Hcjs6woRrZQfmZ3eNPtzU2Oaux_c5OKhVCcLx2EnC8c\"/><figcaption>甘比之後亦有帶同細女入場睇騷。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一起睇騷。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175184655284965376158964.jpeg/_NnueuZDLucAAicd5bo-5lPa7vYPDmR8psXb8JPF2_A\"/><figcaption>一起睇騷。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曾志偉。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183810506133504691247.jpeg/59WL9sJdCgJbzTDweSFC9xD1NfKc3O-Qma9mAqCvZgI\"/><figcaption>曾志偉。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李克勤、盧淑儀。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183812532113408864057.jpeg/LOjFc2rX3N4_np1F86d5ye92vVcVzM3ou8yFOIHMhTg\"/><figcaption>李克勤、盧淑儀。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李克勤、盧淑儀。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183812146368512376402.jpeg/CyhDTzzj4grHhm9ckopHGMp4KWhx3DE711VLpeJVS6U\"/><figcaption>李克勤、盧淑儀。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄺美雲。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183808568233984045618.jpeg/eqjbuRxoSq6kST6_fDdWliSYXypDqF3dyzTfPvI03z4\"/><figcaption>鄺美雲。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"任達華。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183814478532608491256.jpeg/qIl44TcdcvxeLoLyynqyj87MRnRhkrWKQmOGfXdjhn0\"/><figcaption>任達華。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馬海倫。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183814579064832135692.jpeg/fUIbuvn9ALYUPjwCGLJsZf0_3PHIl3o_gMHD5LXBw-Q\"/><figcaption>馬海倫。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚詠麟。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183809923256320528076.jpeg/3Hy7jp43W52aGX0MyLu2sbnZ8fj2uCH1bZ9hi1ifYYs\"/><figcaption>譚詠麟。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚詠麟開騷。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183807867916288675034.jpeg/3uwtZYngkUb8Z6R5IsZg6VlItLGEtmZpx0drDP5Haww\"/><figcaption>譚詠麟開騷。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚詠麟開騷。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183805716107264918642.jpeg/FoUSI_J0MNDhjett3W-vJzxiPGHMVuF9kZZDZqSWQ2Y\"/><figcaption>譚詠麟開騷。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T13:18:38.486370+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":374,"images":14,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}